- Real-time routing decision engine
- Latency guarantees and warm pools
- Minimal provenance logging and data-minimization

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudocode sketch for routing decision
function routePrompt(p, tenant){
  const policy = policyGraph[tenant];
  if (tenant.budgetRemaining <= 0) return 'deny';
  const v = chooseVariant(policy, p);
  return v;
}
```

